<p id="mwxw"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Humid_subtropical_climate" title="Humid subtropical climate" id="mwyA">Humid subtropical climate</a></p>

<p id="mwyQ">The Matsu Islands have a humid subtropical climate and are located in a much colder climate than Taiwan, but no frost has been recorded, for example, bougainvillea grows easily here.</p>

